<rml>
<head>
	<title>Tactical: placement (Phase 5 wireframe)</title>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="../../components.rcss"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="tactical.rcss"/>
</head>
<!-- M2 wireframe of the native tactical HUD (docs/ui/tactical.md), shown over the real tactical world.
     Literal data. Generated by tools/ui/phase5_mocks.py: edit the generator, not this file. -->
<body class="t5">
<div class="t5-root" id="tac">
<div class="ovh-bg"></div><div class="ovh-map hud" id="tac.overhead.map"><img src="overhead-snap"/></div>
	<div class="ovh-side l hud" id="tac.place">
		<div class="sect"><span class="cap">Placement &#183; entering from the north</span><span class="big">A9 &#183; Omerta</span><span class="sm">Place your mercs in the highlighted part of the map. 2 of 4 placed.</span></div>
		<div class="sect"><span class="cap">Mercs</span><div class="row ok" id="tac.place.merc[ivan]"><div class="face"><img class="pic" src="sface-7" data-x="1"/></div><span class="nm">Ivan</span><img class="icon" src="icon-ok"/></div><div class="row ok" id="tac.place.merc[barry]"><div class="face"><img class="pic" src="sface-0" data-x="1"/></div><span class="nm">Barry</span><img class="icon" src="icon-ok"/></div><div class="row todo sel" id="tac.place.merc[grizzly]"><div class="face"><img class="pic" src="sface-3" data-x="1"/></div><span class="nm">Grizzly</span><img class="icon" src="icon-destination"/></div><div class="row todo" id="tac.place.merc[buns]"><div class="face"><img class="pic" src="sface-17" data-x="1"/></div><span class="nm">Buns</span><img class="icon" src="icon-destination"/></div><span class="sm">Click a merc, then click the map; drag a placed merc to move him.</span></div>
		<div class="foot">
			<div class="btns2"><button class="btn" id="tac.place.clear" title="Clear all positions"><span class="label">Clear</span><span class="kbd">C</span></button><button class="btn" id="tac.place.spread" title="Spread the mercs out at random"><span class="label">Spread</span><span class="kbd">S</span></button><button class="btn last" id="tac.place.group" title="Place them as a group"><span class="label">Group</span><span class="kbd">G</span></button></div>
			<button class="btn btn-primary is-disabled" id="tac.place.done" title="Place every merc first"><img class="icon" src="icon-confirm"/><span class="label">Start the battle</span><span class="kbd">Enter</span></button>
		</div>
	</div>
	<div class="zone-note"><div class="banner" style="position: relative; top: 0;"><div class="pill int"><img class="icon" src="icon-destination"/><span class="t">Place Grizzly</span><span class="m">click inside the highlighted zone</span></div></div></div>
</div>
</body>
</rml>
